            {
                "entry_id": "e98469e5-f938-3ab1-8490-d831e482c8c2",
                "word": "condensate",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "5b83fe48-cefb-44ff-9a12-ff241f588437",
                        "entry_id": "e98469e5-f938-3ab1-8490-d831e482c8c2",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "condensates"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "1a65c2ad-0dba-37ef-97fb-c3a0984cea98",
                        "entry_id": "e98469e5-f938-3ab1-8490-d831e482c8c2",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A liquid that is the product of condensation of a gas, i.e. of steam."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "a97630b9-c4cf-4f9e-bfb3-7b13d6799d40",
                                "sense_id": "1a65c2ad-0dba-37ef-97fb-c3a0984cea98",
                                "text": "Do you remember learning about cell diagrams in high school biology? The cell wall, the organelles, the nucleus. The real picture is turning out to be much more complicated, and interesting, than we were taught. Cells are filled with teensy, phase-shifting blobs that often contain protein and RNA, and in the past several years they’ve taken over cellular biology. In our cover story on page 22, science writer Philip Ball dives into the world of these specks, known as biomolecular condensates, which play astounding roles in cellular functioning across all domains of life."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "b683a47b-c4c0-329a-927e-23d08ebbfb73",
                        "entry_id": "e98469e5-f938-3ab1-8490-d831e482c8c2",
                        "glosses": [
                            "The product of a condensation reaction."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "93c27f15-98bb-34d1-9d7f-a6cd4bdef611",
                        "entry_id": "e98469e5-f938-3ab1-8490-d831e482c8c2",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Any of various condensed quantum states."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "3c30a1bf-60ba-43e3-a0c7-665dca009800",
                        "source_entry_id": "e98469e5-f938-3ab1-8490-d831e482c8c2",
                        "source_sense_description": "product of condensation",
                        "target_lang_word": "condensaat",
                        "target_lang_code": "nl",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "condensaat",
                                "target_lang_code": "nl",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a85cb5be-289a-3eaa-be39-5ebf674ad379",
                                        "entry_id": "3a5c374d-c7cc-3584-a505-79065f669933",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "stof die ontstaat bij het afkoelen en verhogen van de druk van een gas"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "vloei"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a9d9ac6a-a944-4958-82e7-1cb47c906501",
                                                "sense_id": "a85cb5be-289a-3eaa-be39-5ebf674ad379",
                                                "text": "Over milieuschade door de aanvaring is nog weinig te zeggen. \"De lading bestaat uit condensaat, een bijproduct van gaswinning\", zegt Luijks. \"Dat is heel licht. Het brandt heel snel en is daarom ook snel 'weggebrand'."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7bc4ddc7-d7bb-4528-a61e-63de97dfb8a8",
                                                "sense_id": "a85cb5be-289a-3eaa-be39-5ebf674ad379",
                                                "text": "Het experiment is belangrijk voor het onderzoek naar fasen van stoffen. De bekendste fasen zijn vast, vloeibaar en gasvormig. Bij extreem lage temperaturen ontstaat een andere fase, het Bose-Einstein condensaat, maar wetenschappers hebben nog niet helemaal door wat er dan gebeurt."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "149c1f82-3372-4a45-b679-8efedb1f7026",
                        "source_entry_id": "e98469e5-f938-3ab1-8490-d831e482c8c2",
                        "source_sense_description": "product of condensation",
                        "target_lang_word": "condensat",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "condensat",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "efcdfa50-6e56-39f6-a655-b67a57837a2c",
                                        "entry_id": "15f8c064-a02a-33e7-95a6-1b04cf68d47f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Matière à l'état solide, liquide ou mélange des deux, obtenue à partir de la phase gazeuse par condensation."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "physical"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f3cf6cfd-dde2-4a4f-a4ab-a3f8df93a567",
                                                "sense_id": "efcdfa50-6e56-39f6-a655-b67a57837a2c",
                                                "text": "Dans le condenseur d'une centrale thermique, la vapeur forme un condensat d'eau liquide pure et retourne dans le cycle."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0ec9d033-5937-3ae0-9ce7-5eefcc0f8acd",
                                        "entry_id": "15f8c064-a02a-33e7-95a6-1b04cf68d47f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Mélange d’hydrocarbures liquides et gazeux dans un gisement de pétrole."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2f421f70-066f-3a24-a675-4d674c0f106f",
                                        "entry_id": "15f8c064-a02a-33e7-95a6-1b04cf68d47f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Condensat de gaz naturel."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Industrie pétrolière"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3d675205-7de2-471c-a012-7915cc622824",
                                                "sense_id": "2f421f70-066f-3a24-a675-4d674c0f106f",
                                                "text": "Les molécules lourdes du gaz naturel forment des condensats à différentes étapes d'extraction, dont une partie est récupérée."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8d14e3fe-3530-328c-85f6-bd418f0ce8fe",
                                        "entry_id": "15f8c064-a02a-33e7-95a6-1b04cf68d47f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "En physique quantique, ensemble de particules occupant le même état fondamental."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "physical"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3284eee8-8a73-408e-9d50-acc32e64f566",
                                                "sense_id": "8d14e3fe-3530-328c-85f6-bd418f0ce8fe",
                                                "text": "Certaines particules peuvent former un condensat de Bose-Einstein."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b9882192-dcc1-3b06-8c50-defcaa265974",
                                        "entry_id": "15f8c064-a02a-33e7-95a6-1b04cf68d47f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Produit principal d'une réaction chimique de condensation entre molécules (la petite molécule éliminée étant le sous-produit)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "note": "s'il s'agit d'un polymère, on parle de polycondensat et de polycondensation",
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "87eb1205-7cc9-4630-8a0a-ae1007da0c7c",
                                                "sense_id": "b9882192-dcc1-3b06-8c50-defcaa265974",
                                                "text": "La réaction d'un alcool avec un acide carboxylique produit un ester comme condensat, avec élimination d'une molécule d'eau comme sous-produit."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b9ea0b86-16a0-3909-9b8c-0f10224a4de5",
                                        "entry_id": "15f8c064-a02a-33e7-95a6-1b04cf68d47f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Résultat d’une opération de hachage sur un message."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
